# Baseline runtime requirements input. Direct dependencies pinned to the versions in the
# manager-verified freeze /tmp/grounded_norm_runtime_environment.freeze.txt (.venv-runtime,
# Python 3.11.6, macOS CPU; `pip check` passed). Transitive pins: use that freeze as the lock.
# Not yet verified on Linux/CUDA: the GPU host must resolve the same versions with a CUDA torch
# build, record CUDA/driver/env hash in configs/runtime_pins.json (runtime_gates_open), and the
# runtime refuses if installed versions differ from those pins.

# Exact source pin: must be recorded in PEP 610 direct_url.json (vcs_info.commit_id);
# the "5.21.0.dev0" version string alone is rejected.
